      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0439_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? But you only have one\n",
        "Pokémon with you.\r",
        "You can’t go off without a Pokémon.\n",
        "Come back another time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0439_00037",
      "en_US": "Do you want your Pokémon back? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0439_00038",
      "en_US": [
